C7A2D"}, {"file_name": "Untitled design (12).png", "id": "993994850150113", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307339_993994853483446_1187314442911025361_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R59wxd7DdcgQ7kNvwEYJB8h&_nc_oc=Ado1_L_lAhaD0E_5EZ8ow_Z3s0dzeFjSRpxdwGfaCSD1A6BXz94mIimVaa0sYd-wX-A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRZh0WWjbhBTSNEY5gEnAsFG0DSeRPBbrqtnJdZ-E9KoQ&oe=6AFC6419"}, {"file_name": "Untitled design (13).png", "id": "1185895656771360", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300897_1185895660104693_1586407616411657046_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_Sto1zhlnUoQ7kNvwFXguve&_nc_oc=AdrLwQAdFoHrcWUszhm0RT3t8WL-v5kkqnFASww3ijtpmNz6LZLZeEWtSIqSUk8IRTU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRHkcGWOA8qc295yX2_vyv8FKsnMtwS0VNnHUKSStgr6Q&oe=6AFC6AAE"}, {"file_name": "Untitled design (14).png", "id": "26507286155543160", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300678_26507286172209825_5695452597013670875_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZbqsVx0CT8sQ7kNvwEfQKWX&_nc_oc=AdrvDGrWXHeDlE8kgBhE5z6fcjCLztZ2XBTG_th1uiFJz2x7sjaEbklCiTJVxR2_Vzs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTIdt7vQiMLw4N6TZGjxxsjWOYzT9yFz7s72N8QGndDvg&oe=6AFC7FB5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Untitled design (4).png", "id": "1344230044390345", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307315_1344230051057011_9037583091754755675_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6a2R0_Pc1mMQ7kNvwGsl72M&_nc_oc=AdroEfoCSMbk2SbF92q9g0CLKe_zkao4gVbn6fnSwv8mT8GfXd81YcVuPG49-Cb4Sqc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRNQuxiRCajDXVbV3ovTo1sTS84GzS8E5PHoqK0RnRwdQ&oe=6AFC612D"}, "display_name": "canopyXchaos", "keywords": [], "long_description": ". Refined Locomotion & Physics\nThe \"feel\" of a Gtag-style game is everything. Even if your movement is solid, constant updates are needed to:\n\nSurface-Specific Friction: Adding \"slippery\" ice walls, \"sticky\" honey or mud, and high-bounce trampolines to change how players navigate.\n\nHaptic Feedback Calibration: Fine-tuning the rumble in the controllers so every \"slap\" and \"jump\" feels impactful and distinct.\n\nCollision Optimization: Fixing those pesky spots where players get their hands stuck in a wall or \"clip\" through the floor.\n\n\ud83e\udde5 2. The Cosmetic & Economy Loop\nIf you want players to keep coming back, they need a reason to \"show off.\"\n\nSeasonal Item Rotations: Introducing limited-time hats, badges, or handheld items tied to real-world holidays (Halloween, Winter, Summer) or in-game \"lore\" events.\n\nPlayer Tiers & Rarity: Implementing \"OG\" badges for early supporters or \"Veteran\" skins that can only be earned through playtime, not just currency.\n\nParticle Effects: Adding \"trails\" or \"glows\" to high-tier items to make them true status symbols in the lobby.\n\n\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f 3. Map Expansion & \"Biome\" Variety\nDon't just add more space; add more variety to the gameplay.\n\nVerticality-Focused Maps: Creating a \"Canyon\" or \"Skyscraper\" map that rewards high-risk jumps and punishes players who fall.\n\nDynamic Environments: Adding moving platforms, rising lava, or water mechanics (swimming is a huge trend in Gtag-likes!) to keep the \"taggers\" on their toes.\n\nThe \"Hub\" Evolution: Constantly updatin", "short_description": "This is a Gtag fangame with some ongoing updates in the works.....always"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1DC1ngVpjsW-XYcvzW7hZn4LY2SLLMiDjrZ92qKT1OXM/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "RNG", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.you